    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7642" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cēto</span></b> , ūs, f.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κητώ</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The wife of Phorcus</i>, <i>and mother
				of Medusa and the Gorgons</i>, <i><span class="en">Luc. 9,
			646</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A Nereid</i>, <i>honored upon the
				Phœnician coast</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 13,
				14, § 69</span></i>.</div>
